resolution: "Explicit get field selection now receives a compact complete selection receipt while preserving canonical identity, requested empty values and independent requested-field budget evidence; default/depth restoration remains truthful."
expected_result: Reduce serialized selected-field cost without hiding budget truncation or removing restoration instructions from default and depth reads.
actual_result: Primary material-receipt and CLI/SDK parity suites passed; all 15 assertion-sensitive evidence controls retained. Real packed Node/Bun selected-status responses are 206 bytes; default/depth attribution and requested-empty cases pass.
